! Defining an outline after it has already written something.
! `!define` is what the keyboard's add-outline panel does: put the entry in the
! editable dictionary and make the strokes again, so the text it wrote becomes
! the text it now means. An empty translation deletes the entry.
HRAOEUBG
TAEUP
!define TAEUP sticky tape
TAEUP
!define TAEUP
TAEUP
